    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d129">

                <pb facs="0485" n="310" xml:id="pg310"/>

                <head>129. Airgram A–142 from Guatemala City, September 11<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d129-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Guatemala City</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1962-09-11T15:17:00-06:00">September 11, 1962, 3:17 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d129-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d129-1"/>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Guidelines for Policy and Operations: Guatemala</item>
                </list>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Policy—Limit Distribution—S/S</hi></p>
                <p>The attached paper was prepared prior to the receipt today of a revised draft of
                    “Guidelines of United States Policy and Operations Towards Guatemala.” While
                    comment on that draft will be forwarded as requested, this paper, it is
                    requested, should be distributed on a limited basis to those concerned with U.S.
                    policy towards Guatemala.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed corresp="#p_BJO_1">John O.
                        Bell</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d129-a1.xml" xpointer="d129-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d129-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d129-f1-content">
                <p>Transmits guidelines for policy and operations in Guatemala. Secret. 10 pp.
                        DOS, CF,
                    611.14/9–1162.</p>
